    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@120754",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter a Doctor of Physic and a Waiting-Gentlewoman.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 24,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 31,
          "end": 50,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@120754/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3684946,
        "end": 3685083,
        "line": 135885,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@120754",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@120895",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOCTOR.\nI have two nights watched with you, but can perceive no truth in your report. When was it she last walked?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@120895/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@120895/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 114,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3685087,
        "end": 3685232,
        "line": 135888,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@120895",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOCTOR.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121044",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEWOMAN.\nSince his Majesty went into the field, I have seen her rise from her bed, throw her nightgown upon her, unlock her closet, take forth paper, fold it, write upon’t, read it, afterwards seal it, and again return to bed; yet all this while in a most fast sleep.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121044/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121044/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 271,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3685236,
        "end": 3685540,
        "line": 135894,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@121044",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEWOMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121352",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOCTOR.\nA great perturbation in nature, to receive at once the benefit of sleep, and do the effects of watching. In this slumbery agitation, besides her walking and other actual performances, what, at any time, have you heard her say?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121352/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121352/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 234,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3685544,
        "end": 3685810,
        "line": 135902,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@121352",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOCTOR.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121622",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEWOMAN.\nThat, sir, which I will not report after her.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121622/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121622/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3685814,
        "end": 3685902,
        "line": 135909,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@121622",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEWOMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121714",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOCTOR.\nYou may to me; and ’tis most meet you should.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121714/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121714/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3685906,
        "end": 3685989,
        "line": 135914,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@121714",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOCTOR.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121801",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEWOMAN.\nNeither to you nor anyone; having no witness to confirm my speech.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121801/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121801/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 79,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3685993,
        "end": 3686102,
        "line": 135919,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@121801",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEWOMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121914",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Lady Macbeth with a taper.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 18,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@121914/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 32,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3686106,
        "end": 3686193,
        "line": 135924,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@121914",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122005",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "Lo you, here she comes! This is her very guise; and, upon my life, fast asleep. Observe her; stand close.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122005/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 105,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3686197,
        "end": 3686328,
        "line": 135926,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@122005",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122140",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOCTOR.\nHow came she by that light?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122140/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122140/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 35,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3686332,
        "end": 3686397,
        "line": 135931,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@122140",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOCTOR.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122209",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEWOMAN.\nWhy, it stood by her: she has light by her continually; ’tis her command.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122209/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122209/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 86,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3686401,
        "end": 3686517,
        "line": 135936,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@122209",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEWOMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122329",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOCTOR.\nYou see, her eyes are open.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122329/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122329/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 35,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3686521,
        "end": 3686586,
        "line": 135941,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@122329",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOCTOR.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122398",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEWOMAN.\nAy, but their sense are shut.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122398/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122398/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 42,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3686590,
        "end": 3686662,
        "line": 135946,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@122398",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEWOMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122474",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOCTOR.\nWhat is it she does now? Look how she rubs her hands.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122474/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122474/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 61,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3686666,
        "end": 3686757,
        "line": 135951,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@122474",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOCTOR.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122569",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GENTLEWOMAN.\nIt is an accustomed action with her, to seem thus washing her hands. I have known her continue in this a quarter of an hour.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122569/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122569/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 137,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3686761,
        "end": 3686929,
        "line": 135956,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@122569",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "GENTLEWOMAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122741",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LADY MACBETH.\nYet here’s a spot.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122741/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 13,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122741/line-2",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 32,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3686933,
        "end": 3686995,
        "line": 135962,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@122741",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LADY MACBETH.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122807",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOCTOR.\nHark, she speaks. I will set down what comes from her, to satisfy my remembrance the more strongly.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122807/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122807/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 107,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3686999,
        "end": 3687137,
        "line": 135967,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@122807",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOCTOR.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122949",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LADY MACBETH.\nOut, damned spot! out, I say! One; two. Why, then ’tis time to do’t. Hell is murky! Fie, my lord, fie! a soldier, and afeard? What need we fear who knows it, when none can call our power to account? Yet who would have thought the old man to have had so much blood in him?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122949/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 13,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@122949/line-2",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 285,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3687141,
        "end": 3687459,
        "line": 135973,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@122949",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LADY MACBETH.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@123271",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DOCTOR.\nDo you mark that?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@123271/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@123271/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 25,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3687463,
        "end": 3687518,
        "line": 135981,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@123271",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "DOCTOR.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@123330",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LADY MACBETH.\nThe Thane of Fife had a wife. Where is she now?—What, will these hands ne’er be clean? No more o’ that, my lord, no more o’ that: you mar all with this starting.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.1/p@123330/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 13,
